Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.71,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,見せておやり
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.71,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Thing's pretty heavy!

Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:05:59.63,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（海賊たち）Oooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:05:59.63,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Can't wait!

Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:02.13,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,ヤッホーイ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:02.13,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Hold yer horses!

Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:07.06,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,あわわわ…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.06,0:06:07.06,English_Main,,0,0,0,,I slept great!

Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.27,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,コビー なんてんですか
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.22,0:06:09.27,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?

Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.69,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,僕 こういうの苦手で…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.69,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Who're you guys?

Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:15.65,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,あん？ 私に口答えしようってのかい？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:15.65,English_Main,,0,0,0,,No, who are you?!

Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:19.40,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,はわわ… どうか金棒の刑だけは…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:19.40,English_Main,,0,0,0,,That guy's gonna catch cold

Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:22.99,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,だったら さっさとお行きーっ！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.49,0:06:22.99,English_Main,,0,0,0,,You did that!

Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.53,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（コビー）うげっ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:24.53,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Are you toyin' with us even

Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:32.66,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（アルビダ）おらあーっ！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:32.66,English_Main,,0,0,0,,when you know we're pirates?!

Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.75,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,ハアーッ！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.75,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm hungry!

Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:43.59,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（海賊）ヘッハッハッハ…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:43.59,English_Main,,0,0,0,,You got any food?

Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:46.51,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,命まで取ろうとは言わねえよ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.01,0:06:46.51,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Listen when people are talking!

Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.97,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,だが 金めのもんは 全部 頂くぜ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.97,English_Main,,0,0,0,,You damn kid!

Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:53.52,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（アルビダ） 抵抗するやつは 海の藻くずになってもらうだけさ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:53.52,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Die!

Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:07:00.69,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（コビー）こんにちは…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:07:00.69,English_Main,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?

Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.49,0:07:04.11,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,ここは誰もいませんね
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.49,0:07:04.11,English_Main,,0,0,0,,W-Who are you?!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:08.62,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,フウ… よかった
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:08.62,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Me?

Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:10.87,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.91,0:07:10.87,English_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Monkey D. Luffy.

Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:11.83,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,ROMAJI
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:11.83,English_Main,,0,0,0,,|ENGLISH_LINE

Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.67,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:16.67,English_Main,,0,0,0,,R-Run, hurry! If they come back \Nwith their friends, you'll be killed!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:20.55,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（ナミ）えいっ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:20.55,English_Main,,0,0,0,,But man, I sure am hungry!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:27.89,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,ずいぶん大きなたるね
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:27.89,English_Main,,0,0,0,,How can you be so carefree?!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:29.72,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,ああ…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:29.72,English_Main,,0,0,0,,

Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.18,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,は？ なんだ おめえ？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.18,English_Main,,0,0,0,,There are still lots more of them up on deck!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:33.98,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,見ねえ顔だな ん？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:33.98,English_Main,,0,0,0,,C'mon! This way!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.40,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（蹴る音） （海賊）うわあ…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.40,English_Main,,0,0,0,,H-H-Hey! Not this way!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:37.65,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,うへーっ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:37.65,English_Main,,0,0,0,,

Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:45.90,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（倒れる音）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:45.90,English_Main,,0,0,0,,

Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:47.07,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（たるを転がす音）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:47.07,English_Main,,0,0,0,,

Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:48.74,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（コビー）クソッ…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:48.74,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Food! Food! Food!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.45,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（海賊Ａ）おい 臆病者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.45,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! Food!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:55.33,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,また こんな所に逃げ込んで 油売ってんのか？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:55.33,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Actually, they might not find us in here!

Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:58.92,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,違います　この大きな酒たる 運ぼうと思って…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:58.92,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Which should I choose? \NThis box?

Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:00.29,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,ヘヘヘッ… 俺たちが軽くしてやるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:00.29,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Ooh, jackpot!

Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:01.34,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,（海賊Ｂ）喉 渇いてたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.46,0:08:01.34,English_Main,,0,0,0,,These look great!

Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:03.88,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,はっ はい そうですね
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:03.88,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Is this a pirate ship?

Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:08.30,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,アルビダ様に知られたら 殺されちゃいます
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:08.30,English_Main,,0,0,0,,No, it's a passenger ship that's \Nbeing raided by Alvida-sama.

Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:11.85,Romaji_Main,,0,0,0,,てめえが黙ってりゃ済むことだ なあ？ コビー
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:11.85,English_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it doesn't matter.

